{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-01/1061170/block/singleImage/3253374/df/01KG54KCZ6TXHQ58ZC4D071SYN.jpg?updatedAt=1793336876\"/><figcaption>將軍澳醫院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>清水灣發生交通意外。 今日（30日）早上10時23分，一輛私家車沿西貢清水灣大坳門道、往將軍澳方向行駛，其間司機報稱避狗，扭右軚後失控鏟上行人路再翻側，司機一度被困車內。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，消防將他救出，他受輕傷由救護車清醒送往將軍澳醫院治理。警方正在調查意外原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:46:25.262621+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:07:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:01.270953+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:39:58.863355+00:00","content_hash":"2b8aa667193565b98e361eac937d6e9ee1175eeba5999ac51a8bcefbd6b84b9e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:46:25.262621+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}